<section class="section first-edit" data-reveal><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">FIND YOUR NEXT FAVOURITE</span><h2>Good scents.<br/><em>Your own way.</em></h2></div><div><p>A selection from the collection.<br/>Keep the scents you love close.</p><a href="/shop" class="text-link">Discover the whole edit ↗</a></div></div><div class="product-grid">@foreach(var p in Shop.Products.Take(4)){<partial name="_Card" model="p"/>}</div></section>
<section class="fashion-story" data-reveal><div class="fashion-story-photo"><img src="@Shop.Settings.Story" alt="A closer look at Perfumes In Lebanon Official" width="900" height="1200" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="fashion-story-copy"><span class="eyebrow">THE WORLD OF PERFUMES IN LEBANON</span><h2>A world of details.<br/><em>A personal choice.</em></h2><p>A scent can make a moment feel your own. Explore bottle photographs, gather a shortlist and ask the Perfumes In Lebanon team about the exact edition, size and packaging before choosing. Ask the team about delivery across Lebanon.</p><a href="/our-world" class="button outline">Discover our world <span>↗</span></a><span class="section-number">02 / Perfumes In Lebanon Official</span></div></section>
<section class="section category-edit" data-reveal><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE DIRECTION</span><h2>What are you<br/><em>in the mood for?</em></h2></div><a href="/style-guide" class="text-link">Help me choose ↗</a></div><div class="category-grid">@foreach(var (category,i) in Shop.Products.Select(p=>p.Collection).Distinct().Take(3).Select((x,i)=>(x,i))){var p=Shop.Products.First(p=>p.Collection==category);<a href="/shop?collection=@Uri.EscapeDataString(category)"><div><img src="@p.Images[0]" alt="@category from Perfumes In Lebanon Official" width="700" height="930" loading="lazy"/></div><span>0@(i+1) / @category <b>↗</b></span></a>}</div></section>
<section class="section diary-feature" data-reveal><div><span class="eyebrow">THE VISUAL DIARY</span><h2>A detail.<br/>A different angle.<br/><em>A new favourite.</em></h2><p>Explore the collection in photographs. Follow a colour, discover a silhouette and gather your inspiration.</p><a href="/lookbook" class="button">Open the photo diary <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="diary-pair"><img src="@Shop.Products.Last().Images[0]" alt="Collection inspiration from Perfumes In Lebanon Official" width="720" height="960" loading="lazy"/><img src="@Shop.Products.Skip(1).First().Images.Last()" alt="More collection details from Perfumes In Lebanon Official" width="520" height="690" loading="lazy"/></div></section>
<section class="section shopping-steps" data-reveal><div><span class="eyebrow">MAKE IT PERSONAL</span><h2>From inspiration<br/><em>to a conversation.</em></h2></div><ol><li><span>01</span><h3>Find your favourites</h3><p>Browse the collection, explore the photographs and save the scents that speak to you.</p></li><li><span>02</span><h3>Build your selection</h3><p>Add your fragrances to a bag and share your size, colour and delivery questions.</p></li><li><span>03</span><h3>Talk to the team</h3><p>Review your enquiry before sending. The store confirms options, availability and the final price.</p></li></ol></section>
